{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55535","headline":"偈 三 · 契此","name":"偈 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾有三宝堂，里空（《明州岳林寺志》作「有」）无色相。\n不高亦不低，无遮亦无障。\n学者体不如，求者难得样。\n智慧（《布袋和尚传》作「者」）解安排，千中（《布袋和尚传》、《明州岳林寺志》作「古」）无一匠。\n四门四果生，十方尽供养。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"契此","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}